 "_about": "The rk run: an unattended search for Runge-Kutta coefficients that do best in Q15 fixed point with floor rounding, at a fixed 65,536-cycle budget on a modeled Cortex-M0+. Every result below is epoch 1 unless its block says epoch 2.",
